{"title":"Career Roadmap: Wedding Planner","role":"Wedding Planner","summary":"A Wedding Planner manages the planning and execution of weddings and related celebrations. The role combines:","facts":{"Current degree":"Hospitality, Travel & Aviation","Course":"BHM / B.Sc Hospitality & Hotel Administration / BTTM"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build expertise in wedding planning, event operations, budgeting, vendor management, hospitality, décor, guest experience and wedding production"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Wedding Planner manages the planning and execution of weddings and related celebrations. The role combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Event Management","Hospitality","Project Management","Vendor Coordination","Budgeting","Design","Customer Experience"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Client consultation"},{"text":"Wedding concept development"},{"text":"Budget planning"},{"text":"Venue selection"},{"text":"Vendor sourcing"},{"text":"Décor coordination"},{"text":"Catering coordination"},{"text":"Guest management"},{"text":"Travel and accommodation"},{"text":"Entertainment"},{"text":"Photography/videography coordination"},{"text":"Timeline management"},{"text":"On-site execution"},{"text":"Crisis management"},{"text":"Post-event settlement"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A graduate will generally begin as a Wedding/Event Coordinator, Wedding Executive, Event Operations Executive or Client Servicing Executive before independently managing large weddings."}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof to Create","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Hospitality & event foundations"},{"text":"Hospitality, communication, event basics"},{"text":"Mock wedding concept"},{"text