ation"},{"text":"Client qualification"},{"text":"Consultation"},{"text":"Proposal writing"},{"text":"Package design"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Follow-up"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Referral marketing"},{"text":"Social media marketing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing Channels"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Instagram"},{"text":"YouTube"},{"text":"Pinterest"},{"text":"Google"},{"text":"Wedding platforms"},{"text":"Website"},{"text":"WhatsApp"},{"text":"Referrals"},{"text":"Venue partnerships"},{"text":"Hotel partnerships"}]}]},{"heading":"Wedding Business Economics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Cost"},{"text":"Gross margin"},{"text":"Vendor commissions/fees where applicable"},{"text":"Client acquisition cost"},{"text":"Package pricing"},{"text":"Contribution"},{"text":"Cash flow"},{"text":"Advance payments"},{"text":"Working capital"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"If the planner charges ₹10 lakh and total direct/operating costs are ₹7 lakh:"},{"type":"h","text":"Contribution = ₹3 lakh"},{"type":"p","text":"The actual profit will depend on overheads, taxes, salaries and other business expenses."}]},{"heading":"Risk & Crisis Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Weddings have many time-sensitive risks."},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rain"},{"text":"Extreme weather"},{"text":"Vendor cancellation"},{"text":"Artist cancellation"},{"text":"Power failure"},{"text":"AV failure"},{"text":"Transportation delays"},{"text":"Catering problems"},{"text":"Guest medical emergency"},{"text":"Lost belongings"},{"text":"Crowd issues"},{"text":"Schedule delays"},{"text":"Venue problems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Risk","Probability","Impact","Owner","Preventive Action","Backup Plan"]},{"type":"p","text":"A wedding planner should always maintain backup vendors and contingency time f